{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS"]]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An encodable view of the entities of a nexus and their serializable components."}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/SerializableComponent","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NonSerializableComponentHandling","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentSerializationError","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/EntityReferenceResolver","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/EntityReferenceError"],"anchor":"Snapshots","title":"Snapshots","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NexusSnapshot","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentMacro","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/SavingAndLoadingScenes"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A snapshot references the live components and entity identifier generator of the nexus. Encode it right after creation.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The encoded form starts with the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusSnapshot\/formatVersion","isActive":true},{"text":" and lists all entities in ascending identifier order,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"each with its original identifier (the raw value, here with generation 0) and its components keyed by their stable ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/RegistrableComponent\/componentTypeName","isActive":true},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"json","code":["{","  \"formatVersion\": 3,","  \"entityIdGenerator\": { \"nextFreshId\": 3, \"recycledIds\": [] },","  \"entities\": [","    { \"id\": 1, \"components\": { \"MyGame.Position\": { \"x\": 1, \"y\": 2 } } },","    { \"id\": 2, \"components\": {}, \"sharedComponents\": { \"MyGame.Position\": 1 } }","  ]","}"]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"entityIdGenerator"},{"text":" is present if the generator of the nexus is a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/PersistableEntityIdentifierGenerator"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"sharedComponents","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is present for entities that share a component instance with an entity listed before them."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Components are values since 2.0, so snapshots never write it; it is still read from older data."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It maps the component type name to the identifier of the entity that encodes the instance."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Version history:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1: Entities and their components."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"2: Adds "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"entityIdGenerator"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sharedComponents"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"3: Entity identifiers are encoded as 64 bit raw values holding the slot index and generation."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"The generator state lists recycled identifiers as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","